silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_05_part_whole_immunity_sections_01_olog_vs_subapex_yoneda_hom_legs silm:hasExample "In 'OlogVsSubapexYonedaHomLegs', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Theorem 16.4 supplies a kind-discipline witness arrow that blocks the cheese trap of treating D_Mittens (functor) and colim D_Mittens (object) as the same; the witness is the colimit construction itself, which is an operator, not an identity." .
